['<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "how about some testimonies from real health experts ?" means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Medical experts have shared insights on health topics." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Experts found that regular physical activity can reduce the risk of chronic diseases like heart disease, diabetes, and certain cancers." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Experts in health are being asked to give their statements." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Some real health experts could provide testimonies." means in one word:"'] 33750
