al explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: The sun was shining brightly overhead, casting a warm glow over the entire scene. In the distance, a group of children could be seen laughing and playing together, their joyful shouts and giggles carrying on the breeze. Amidst this lively backdrop, a little girl stood out, completely absorbed in her own fun.\n\nShe was standing in the middle of a large water jet fountain, the cool mist dancing around her as she twirled and spun to her heart's content. Water sprayed from the fountain's various nozzles, creating a mesmerizing display of light and sound that seemed to captivate the little girl's attention.\n\nAs she played, the water jets seemed to be her personal playground, with each spray and gush sending her into fits of delight. She leapt and danced, her eyes shining with excitement, her ponytail bouncing behind her. The sound of the water created a soothing background melody, punctuated by the occasional splash and the happy shouts of the little girl.\n\nThe other children in the background added to the scene's energy, their own games and activities weaving in and out of the little girl's playtime in the fountain. Some were climbing on a nearby jungle gym, while others were chasing each other around the playground equipment. But the little girl in the fountain remained the star of the show, lost in her own little world of water and wonder.\n\nAs she played, the water jets seemed to be her personal friends, each one a new and exciting discovery waiting to be made. She chased after a particularly vigorous spray, laughing as it tickled her skin and sent her spinning around in circles. And when she finally emerged from the fountain, dripping wet and grinning from ear to ear, it was clear that she had experienced a truly magical moment."}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\n